ARCHITECTURE (mirrors the A7 DrivesList / Statistics precedents)
  RegenEfficiencyPageModel.kt      framework-free: registration ids; parseRegenAnalytics
                                   (decodes GET /analytics/regen → RegenEfficiencyAnalytics,
                                   present-guard = web `data ?`); the verbatim ports of the web
                                   useMemo chain over the windowed drives — regenRatioOf
                                   (web getRegenRatio), filterDrivesToRange (web allDrives.filter),
                                   monthlyTrend (web monthlyTrend), recentRegenDrives (web
                                   regenDrives); RegenRange (web useRangeState, preset 'all');
                                   RegenDisplayPrefs (web useUnits) — formatEnergy/formatPower +
                                   convertDistanceFromSI/convertEnergyFromSI at the boundary;
                                   recordRegenEfficiencyPageOpened (view.opened); mapData.
  RegenEfficiencyPageSource.kt     seam over DrivingRepository.regenEfficiency (web
                                   useRegenEfficiency, GET /analytics/regen [start,end]) +
                                   DrivingRepository.drives (web useDrives) + SettingsStore.settings
                                   (web useUnits) + SelectedVehicleStore (web useSelectedVehicle).
  RegenEfficiencyPageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel; regenState: StateFlow<UiState<
                                   RegenEfficiencyAnalytics>> re-collected on vehicle/range/refresh,
                                   gated on the active vehicle, empty when !present (web `data ?`);
                                   drivesState: StateFlow<UiState<List<Drive>>>; range: StateFlow<
                                   RegenRange>; displayPrefs StateFlow; setRange/refresh/retry/
                                   recordViewOpened. No HTTP in the view.
  RegenEfficiencyPage.kt           stateless RegenEfficiencyPageContent + the ten Material 3
                                   panels; the backend analytics drive the gauge/cards/bars, the
                                   useDrives feed is windowed by the model into the trend + table.
  RegenEfficiencyPageHost.kt       registers RegenEfficiencyRoute for the `regenEfficiency`
                                   destination (Destinations.kt L75, /regen-efficiency); wired in
                                   TeslaSyncApplication.onCreate() (NavHost registration).

SI BOUNDARY (P1/S5)
  The analytics envelope + drives stay SI on the wire (Wh, watts, meters). Display conversion
  happens only at the render boundary via RegenDisplayPrefs.energy/power (shared formatEnergy/
  formatPower), toDistanceDisplay (convertDistanceFromSI) and energyKwhBare/kwhWithUnit
  (convertEnergyFromSI) — never stored converted (Phase-48 SI-canonical; ADR-013 keeps cache SI).

LIVE DATA / STALENESS (ADR-013)
  Neither source is an SSE live feed; both are cache-then-network Resource streams projected to
  UiState, so the header DataFreshness chip surfaces fetchedAt / refreshing / stale / error rather
  than a >2 min live-staleness badge (no live source on this page).

